MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi Marc,

When you set:

distsamp(..., output="density")

unmarked uses log(area) as an offset in the abundance part of the model, and as a result you are effectively modeling density. So, there is no need to add the offset yourself. Does that make sense?

Richard

